            <ArticleTitle>Osteoid osteoma as a cause of hip pain in a young athlete.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>50-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of osteoid osteoma as a cause of hip pain in a young athlete. Excision of the lesion resulted in complete relief of the symptoms.</AbstractText>
